	)
	(text_box "@{\"Id\":\"ZIXZNGM~{T}SFEMXHVR\",\"ObjectType\":2} & @{\"Id\":\"ZIXZNGM~{T}RAKTZDGZ\",\"ObjectType\":2} form a HPF with the headphones\n\n94uF and 80ohm (39.2ohm + 50ohm headphones) gives a -3dB cutoff frequency at 18Hz\n\nClass1 capcitors don't exist in >1uf so needs to be class2.  Class2 can lose up to 40% capacitance at 8V DC Bias so may need to put bigger capacitor or double-stack.\nX7R has less capacitance losses than X5R"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 252.73 148.59 0)
		(size -59.69 30.48)
		(margins 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525)
		(stroke
			(width 0)
			(type default)
			(color 0 0 0 1)
		)
		(fill
			(type color)
			(color 255 255 150 1)
		)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "27cabbd5-65db-4739-b6e9-8a829eb15282")
	)
	(text_box "-ADC reads voltage drop when @{\"Id\":\"PNZACEDM\\OLGKWONJ\",\"ObjectType\":2} is connected. \n- @{\"Id\":\"PNZACEDM\\OLGKWONJ\",\"ObjectType\":2} needs to be 10MΩ to prevent loading a guitar pickup more (already a 1M input resistor @{\"Id\":\"PNZACEDM\\FIJOSKNR\",\"ObjectType\":2} & OPAMP Zin)\n- @{\"Id\":\"PNZACEDM\\QVKJQOKV\",\"ObjectType\":2} provides current for sampling\n-RC time constant (10M & 1nF)= ~~20ms"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 246.38 110.49 0)
		(size -48.26 20.32)
		(margins 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525)
		(stroke
			(width 0)
			(type default)
			(color 0 0 0 1)
		)
		(fill
			(type color)
			(color 255 255 150 1)
		)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "e68ee405-aac3-41cd-b5e5-538d7653440d")
	)
